sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>/tenants/{id}/extract
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Celery as Celery task<br/>leasegenie.extract_tenant
    participant Pipeline as pipeline.<br/>run_extraction_for_tenant
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>(multi-agent)

    User->>+API: POST /tenants/TENANT_ID/extract
    API->>+DB: db.get Tenant
    DB-->>-API: Tenant row
    API->>API: Validate: has documents?
    alt No documents uploaded
        API-->>User: 409 tenant has no documents
    end
    API->>+DB: Insert ExtractionJob<br/>status=queued
    DB-->>-API: job_id
    API->>+Celery: extract_tenant_task.delay(<br/>tenant_id, job_id)
    Note over Celery: If CELERY_TASK_ALWAYS_EAGER<br/>runs inline; else queued
    Celery->>+Pipeline: run_extraction_for_tenant(<br/>tenant, job_id)
    Pipeline->>DB: UPDATE job status=running,<br/>started_at=now
    Pipeline->>DB: UPDATE docs ocr_status=<br/>ocr_in_progress
    Pipeline->>+Coord: coordinator.run(<br/>abstract_type, property_type,<br/>documents,<br/>on_progress, on_result)

    loop per field × per document
        Coord->>Coord: Extract one field<br/>(see Flow 5)
        Coord->>Pipeline: on_result(AgentFieldResult)
        Pipeline->>DB: Upsert FieldValue<br/>+ AuditLog entry
        Coord->>Pipeline: on_progress(done, total)
        Pipeline->>DB: UPDATE job progress=N%,<br/>completed_fields=N
    end

    Coord->>Coord: ReconciliationAgent.run<br/>(cross-doc checks)
    Coord-->>-Pipeline: (final_results, report)

    Pipeline->>DB: UPDATE docs ocr_status=complete
    loop per red_flag in report
        Pipeline->>DB: Insert AuditLog<br/>action=red_flag
    end
    Pipeline->>DB: UPDATE job status=complete,<br/>progress=100,<br/>finished_at=now
    Pipeline-->>-Celery: done
    Celery-->>-API: (async)

    API->>+DB: Refresh job row
    DB-->>-API: current status
    API-->>-User: 202 Accepted {job_id, status, progress}

    Note over User,API: Client polls GET /jobs/{job_id}
    User->>+API: GET /jobs/{job_id}
    API->>+DB: db.get ExtractionJob
    DB-->>-API: {status, progress, completed_fields, total_fields}
    API-->>-User: JobOut
